	quest.1C69AFD1BECB977B.quest_desc: [
		"Multiblock machines with scattered inventories across several blocks are difficult to automate, but the Machine Hub solves this by acting as a single proxy inventory for your Pattern Provider"
		""
		"Simply place it touching the multiblock and press Scan at the top to automatically map, link, and route items and fluids to their respective inputs while pulling finished outputs back into your network automatically"
		""
		"The Hub operates as a real ME device, consuming 11 channels for the Hub itself plus an additional channel for every linked inventory, so you need to use dense cables to connect it"
		""
		"For the complete guide just press &lG&r while hovering over the Machine Hub or the Hub Linker"
	]
